// Name :
"P5993427" "Coyote"
// TELEPORT_STRING :
"P2718781814" "<img src=COH_HealthLevelUp.tga><br>I see you have enough experience points to reach level 2. Notice the arrow in your Status Circle. You need to visit a signature hero to raise your security level and receive a new power.<br><br>Select Atlas Park to continue your saga:<br><linkhoverbg #118866aa><link white><linkhover white><table><a href=CONTACTLINK_NEWPLAYERTELEPORT_AP><tr><td>Visit Ms. Liberty in Atlas Park</td></tr></a>"
// TELEPORT_STRING :
"P2279636886" "<img src=COH_HealthLevelUp.tga><br>I see you have enough experience points to reach level 2. Notice the arrow in your Status Circle. You need to visit a signature hero to raise your security level and receive a new power.<br><br>You may choose what zone to start in:<br><linkhoverbg #118866aa><link white><linkhover white><table><a href=CONTACTLINK_NEWPLAYERTELEPORT_GC><tr><td>Visit Back Alley Brawler in Galaxy City</td></tr></a><a href=CONTACTLINK_NEWPLAYERTELEPORT_AP><tr><td>Visit Ms. Liberty in Atlas Park</td></tr></a>"
// ProfessionString :
"P415441728" "Heroic Mentor"
// DescriptionString :
"P2403994310" "Matthew Bragg never sought the mantle of Hero, but when Old Man Coyote needed an avatar on earth, Matthew was selected. An excellent crime-fighter with a magical sense of humor, Coyote is renowned for his tutelage and mentoring. He is always around to show new Heroes in Paragon City the ropes."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2795972436" "I don't talk to villains, {HeroName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P856364347" ""
// HelloString :
"P3026808530" "{TELEPORT_STRING}"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3309832969" "You need to finish your work for {LastContactName} before you can help me."
// ZeroContactPointsString :
"P2358666509" "Looks like you are learning your stuff, {HeroName}. Let's finish this job with one last task I'd like you to undertake."
// NeverIssuedTaskString :
"P4124935971" "<color deepskyblue>Click on 'Ask about available missions' to proceed.</color>"
// LocationString :
"P2234799313" "Outbreak"
// IntroString :
"P2802568834" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Click here to accept Coyote as a new contact</A>."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3531339467" "Click here to proceed to Coyote"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2392352388" "Use your compass or map to find Coyote."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3504971471" "You should speak with Ms. Liberty in Atlas Park. They can finalize your Security clearance."
