"P194545998" "Officer Flint"
// ProfessionString :
"P591860795" "Traffic Cop"
// DescriptionString :
"P339267781" "Officer Flint has simple duties in the Paragon City Police Department, but when a crisis arises he's always first to volunteer for extra duty. His friendly nature and good heart make him an ideal contact for new heroes learning their way around Paragon City."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FirstVisitString :
// HelloString :
"P1239059044" "HelloString"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P973700779" "IDontKnowYou"
// ZeroContactPointsString :
"P2461598419" "We have a crisis going on here, and we need help desperately. Some thugs took an experimental drug thinking it was something else, and now they're trashing the area. We have to regain control to ensure the safety of the citizens."
// NeverIssuedTaskString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P11957569" "You should go see {LastContactName} now, {HeroName}. There's nothing more you can do for me."
// LocationString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3701740451" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Officer Parks</A> radioed. He needs help fighting off some rioting thugs down the street."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


