"P2778085338" "Sergeant Hicks"
// ProfessionString :
"P1076038289" "Police Sergeant"
// DescriptionString :
"P192477935" "Sergeant Hicks is a former Hero who lost his powers shortly before the Rikti war. He felt useless on the sidelines during the war, so he joined the police force. He was recently promoted because of exemplary field work. Although new to his position, he has earned the confidence of all his fellow officers."
// WrongAllianceString :
// FirstVisitString :
// IDontKnowYouString :
// ZeroContactPointsString :
"P1993766021" "Hey there, {HeroName}. When I was a hero, I learned a thing or two. When you defeat a foe, you may recieve <color lightblue>Inspirations</color> in your Inspiration Tray.<br><br><img src=COH_ToolbarInspiration.tga><br><br> These can help you by giving you Hit Points, Endurance, or improved attacks. To use one, left click on the icon of the Inspiration. To learn about an Inspiration, right click on the icon."
// NeverIssuedTaskString :
// NoTasksRemainingString :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4256810197" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>Click here to accept Sergeant Hicks as a new contact</A>."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3537416461" "Click here to proceed to Sergeant Hicks"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2455704970" "Use your compass or map to find Sergeant Hicks."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3166952431" "It looks like <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Coyote</A> has learned something about the drug."
// StoreTitleString :
"P3591353593" "This is an error for this contact."
